 magical day  what do you say to those critics that  suggest you shouldn't be interfering in  the situation I don't think they  understand what's going on in Venezuela  and they you know there was one artist  that said that everything is great in  Venezuela nobody's suffering and you  know I'll just say you know what if  nobody's suffering why three million  Venezuelans left their country and you  know they just need they need to they  need to read you know they need to be  educated on it I think it has the chance  of being a turning point I mean it looks  like we're going to have hundreds of  thousands of Venezuelans coming coming  here today and if you if you go out into  the crowd and talk to them you'll find  that they are crying crying out for  crying out for help and you know we're  not going to stop with this concert will  be doing mostly other concerts in  America we'll keep keep keep it up until  until things change
 

